      "helptext": "Time scale over which the forecast decays from the real precipitation (near future) to the corrupted precipitation (far future). The real series is weighted by exp(-(tau-t)/time_scale) and the corrupted series by 1-exp(-(tau-t)/time_scale).",
      "criteria": "time_scale>0",
      "warningmessage": "Forecast trust time scale must be greater than zero"
    },
    "diameter": {
